WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.138
ROW_NUMBER assigns a unique sequence even when
values tie This

00:00:06.151 --> 00:00:10.257
makes it useful for selecting exactly the top two or
top three rows per group

00:00:11.991 --> 00:00:16.517
But if salaries tie and you only order by salary the
sequence among tied rows

00:00:16.543 --> 00:00:22.436
may not be deterministic Add a stable tie-breaker
such as employee ID

00:00:22.449 --> 00:00:23.541
when the order matters
